.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt PURGE 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm purge
.Nd empty the disk buffers
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
asks the kernel to empty its disk buffers.
It takes no arguments.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 on success and 1 on failure.
